Popsicle 0.1.3

This package contains a vendored and adapted Riverpod 2.6.1 engine under
lib/src/engine and lib/src/flutter_engine. Riverpod is licensed under the MIT
License; see LICENSE and the original attribution retained in this project.

Popsicle-specific public APIs include:
- Dependency / Dependency.params
- Store / ActionStore
- StoreProvider / StoreProvider.params
- AsyncState / Async.combine
- PopsicleScope / PopsicleWidget / PopsicleStatefulWidget
- PopsicleBuilder
- Store-focused PopsicleConsumer with listener/listenWhen/buildWhen
